    "created_at": "2018-04-09T13:27:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-09T13:27:22Z",
    "body": "More precisely, what is giving us compat problems is an image which represents nothing, has no alt text, but has CSS styles giving it a width/height.  Those get ignored, because it's an inline element per spec.  Other browsers don't do that.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
