    "updated_at": "2018-04-09T13:28:57Z",
    "body": "And also, the spec's concept of \"has no alt text\" (that is, no alt attribute) may not match some browsers' concept (seems to be some test whether getAttribute(\"alt\") is falsy, basically, so take that path for both no attr and `alt=\"\"`).",
