    "created_at": "2018-04-09T13:45:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-09T13:45:00Z",
    "body": "(Note that I think that some of the interop differences are in fact due to the wording issues, because some browsers ignored the actual meaning of \"intrinsic dimensions\" and relied instead on the parenthetical \"e.g.\" bit to decide what the behavior should be.  Sort of.)",
